msgstr "O nama"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:45
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli!"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:48
msgid ""
"This project is created for fun and designed as a structured catalog of dog "
"breeds, focused on clarity, comparison, and easy navigation.\n"
"            The main classification system follows the <strong>FCI "
"(Fédération Cynologique Internationale)</strong>."
msgstr "Ovaj projekat je nastao iz zabave i zamišljen je kao strukturisan katalog rasa pasa, usmeren na jasnoću, poređenje i jednostavnu navigaciju.\n            Glavni sistem klasifikacije prati standarde <strong>FCI (Fédération Cynologique Internationale)</strong>."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:52
msgid "What is FCI"
msgstr "Šta je FCI"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:55
msgid ""
"FCI — Fédération Cynologique Internationale (International Canine "
"Federation) — the largest international federation of kennel clubs, which "
"defines official breed standards and group structures worldwide."
msgstr "FCI — Fédération Cynologique Internationale (Međunarodna kinološka federacija) — najveća međunarodna federacija kinoloških saveza koja definiše zvanične standarde rasa i strukturu grupa širom sveta."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:59
msgid "Founded on 22 May 1911, headquartered in Thuin, Belgium."
msgstr "Osnovana 22. maja 1911. godine, sa sedištem u Tenu (Thuin), Belgija."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:60
msgid "98 member countries."
msgstr "98 zemalja članica."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:61
msgid ""
"Recognizes 356 breeds; each breed belongs to its country of origin, which "
"writes its standard; FCI publishes standards in 4 languages (en/fr/de/es)"
msgstr "Priznaje 356 rasa; svaka rasa pripada zemlji porekla, koja piše njen standard; FCI objavljuje standarde na 4 jezika (en/fr/de/es)"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:65
msgid ""
"To provide a broader perspective, the catalog also incorporates data from "
"other kennel organizations, as well as independent breed sources.\n"
"            As a result, the database includes not only officially "
"recognized breeds, but also less common and developing ones."
msgstr "Da bi se dobila šira perspektiva, katalog obuhvata i podatke drugih kinoloških organizacija i nezavisnih izvora o rasama.\n            Kao rezultat, baza podataka uključuje ne samo zvanično priznate rase, već i manje poznate i one u razvoju."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:70
msgid ""
"If a breed is missing, it may not yet be added or sufficient reference "
"material is still being collected."
msgstr "Ako rasa nedostaje, možda još nije dodata ili se i dalje prikuplja dovoljno referentnog materijala."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:74
msgid "About classification"
msgstr "O klasifikaciji"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:78
msgid "The catalog combines:"
msgstr "Katalog objedinjuje:"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:79
msgid "officially recognized FCI breeds and groups"
msgstr "zvanično priznate FCI rase i grupe"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:80
msgid "breeds recognized by other kennel clubs"
msgstr "rase koje priznaju drugi kinološki savezi"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:81
msgid "rare or developing breeds not yet formally classified"
msgstr "retke ili rase u razvoju koje još nisu formalno klasifikovane"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:85
msgid ""
"Breed classification may vary between kennel organizations.\n"
"            The same breed can be assigned to different groups depending on "
"the standard used."
msgstr "Klasifikacija rasa može da se razlikuje između kinoloških organizacija.\n            Ista rasa može biti svrstana u različite grupe u zavisnosti od primenjenog standarda."


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:90
msgid "For official FCI standards, you can visit the"
msgstr "Zvanične FCI standarde možete pogledati na"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:95 woof/templates/woof/about.html:96
msgid "FCI website"
msgstr "FCI veb-sajtu"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:102
msgid ""
"You can also find practical and helpful information about dog care, "
"training, behavior, and daily life in the"
msgstr "Praktične i korisne informacije o nezi pasa, obuci, ponašanju i svakodnevnom životu možete pronaći i u"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:106 woof/templates/woof/about.html:107
#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:60
msgid "Guides section"
msgstr "odeljku Vodiči"


#: woof/templates/woof/about.html:113
msgid "Enjoy exploring, learning, and discovering dog breeds :)"
msgstr "Uživajte u istraživanju, učenju i otkrivanju rasa pasa :)"


