#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:150
msgid "Lifestyle & ownership"
msgstr "Životni stil i briga o psu"


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:226
msgid "By living conditions"
msgstr "Po uslovima života"


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:302
msgid "Other characteristics"
msgstr "Ostale karakteristike"


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:383
msgid ""
"It is important to realistically consider how much time you can dedicate to "
"walks, training, and interaction. Some dogs require constant activity and "
"stimulation, while others are calm and adapt to a slower pace.<br> "
"<strong>Grooming needs also vary significantly</strong> between breeds."
msgstr "Važno je da realno razmislite o tome koliko vremena možete posvetiti šetnjama, obuci i interakciji. Neki psi zahtevaju stalnu aktivnost i stimulaciju, dok su drugi smireni i prilagođavaju se sporijem ritmu.<br> <strong>Potrebe za negom takođe se značajno razlikuju</strong> među rasama."


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:389
msgid ""
"<strong>Living conditions matter.</strong> Not every dog is suited for "
"apartment life, and barking levels can affect daily comfort. Experience also "
"plays a role — some breeds are easy for beginners, while others require "
"patience and confidence."
msgstr "<strong>Uslovi života su bitni.</strong> Nije svaki pas pogodan za život u stanu, a nivo lajanja može uticati na svakodnevni komfor. Iskustvo takođe igra ulogu — neke rase su lake za početnike, dok druge zahtevaju strpljenje i samopouzdanje."


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:395
msgid ""
"<strong>Health and allergies should not be overlooked.</strong> While no dog "
"is completely hypoallergenic, some are more suitable for sensitive owners."
msgstr "<strong>Zdravlje i alergije ne treba zanemariti.</strong> Iako nijedan pas nije potpuno hipoalergen, neke rase su pogodnije za osetljive vlasnike."


#: woof/templates/woof/dog_groups.html:399
msgid ""
"Taking time to understand these factors helps you make a thoughtful choice."
"<br> This page is designed to guide you with simple, practical groups — "
"helping you find a dog that truly fits your lifestyle."
msgstr "Odvojiti vreme da razumete ove faktore pomaže vam da napravite promišljen izbor.<br> Ova stranica je zamišljena da vas vodi kroz jednostavne, praktične grupe — kako biste pronašli psa koji zaista odgovara vašem životnom stilu."


#: woof/templates/woof/dogs_list.html:25 woof/templates/woof/dogs_list.html:26
#: woof/templates/woof/dogs_list.html:41 woof/templates/woof/groups.html:26
